3490
01:57:58,240 --> 01:57:58,790
C'est parti.

3491
01:57:59,740 --> 01:58:00,660
Allons-y.

3492
01:58:03,410 --> 01:58:04,279
"I can't touch this."

3493
01:58:06,529 --> 01:58:07,129
"I can't touch this."

3494
01:58:07,200 --> 01:58:07,930
Très bien.

3495
01:58:09,169 --> 01:58:09,919
"I can't touch this."

3496
01:58:10,680 --> 01:58:11,660
Bien joué.

3497
01:58:12,069 --> 01:58:13,870
"You can't touch this."

3498
01:58:17,049 --> 01:58:17,250
La boucle a donc été ajoutée pour Yale.

3499
01:58:17,250 --> 01:58:17,250
Bien.
3500
01:58:17,379 --> 01:58:18,560
2 Yale maintenant.

3501
01:58:25,290 --> 01:58:25,589
Très bien,

3502
01:58:25,770 --> 01:58:27,200
3 Yale maintenant.

3503
01:58:30,470 --> 01:58:31,020
Super.

3504
01:58:32,370 --> 01:58:33,160
Intouchable !

3505
01:58:34,009 --> 01:58:35,060
Voici le MIT.

3506
01:58:39,500 --> 01:58:39,509
Très

3507
01:58:40,399 --> 01:58:40,930
bien,

3508
01:58:41,049 --> 01:58:41,410
ouais.

3509
01:58:43,879 --> 01:58:45,080
Deux MIT.

3510
01:58:49,169 --> 01:58:49,560
Et attrape

3511
01:58:57,350 --> 01:58:57,870
Super,

3512
01:58:58,229 --> 01:58:58,779
oui.

3513
01:59:10,109 --> 01:59:10,140
Ça

3514
01:59:11,790 --> 01:59:11,819
Je

3515
01:59:15,109 --> 01:59:15,540
Oui.

3516
01:59:16,140 --> 01:59:16,979
Maintenant Princeton.

3517
01:59:20,779 --> 01:59:21,910
Un autre Princeton.

3518
01:59:29,620 --> 01:59:31,020
Avant-dernier niveau.

3519
01:59:33,810 --> 01:59:33,859
Je

3520
01:59:37,240 --> 01:59:37,629
OK

3521
01:59:55,450 --> 01:59:55,629
Passez un

3522
02:00:02,580 --> 02:00:03,089
Continuons,

3523
02:00:03,250 --> 02:00:03,799
on continue.

3524
02:00:13,649 --> 02:00:13,689
Ouais

3525
02:00:15,919 --> 02:00:15,930
Très

3526
02:00:16,750 --> 02:00:17,100
bien,

3527
